OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after man dies while
OL,4,Aawaiting surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has issued a warning to NHS
OL,7,Forganisations in a bid to prevent
OL,8,Ffuture deaths after a delay in treating
OL,9,Fa patient with a "time-critical
OL,10,Fsurgical emergency".
OL,12,FMalcolm Budd, 65, died at Glenfield
OL,13,FHospital in Leicester before surgeons
OL,14,Fcould operate on a tear in the artery -
OL,15,Fknown as an aortic dissection - in
OL,16,FFebruary.
OL,18,FHe had been transferred there from the
OL,19,FRoyal Derby Hospital after it was
OL,20,Festablished the procedure could not be
OL,21,Fperformed in Derby or Nottingham.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
