OL,3,GNEWSAWarning after man dies while
OL,4,Aawaiting surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoroner Dianne Hocking said a "lack of
OL,7,Fagreement between local hospitals" had
OL,8,Fled to "delays" in transferring
OL,9,Fpatients with acute aortic dissection.
